{"about_the_game":"\u201cTake up these goods, and imbue them with purpose.\u201d<br><br>Show your love for Darkest Dungeon II by adopting this Infernal Supporter Pack! The pack is a collection of cosmetic items for players who want to help bolster the work we've done to add many free updates to the game. (Such as Kingdoms!)<br><br>The Infernal Supporter Pack contains:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Infernal weapon kits with special inkfire visual effects. Arm your heroes with implements tainted by the spreading stain.<br></li><li>Infernal hero palettes with additional inkfire visual effects. Heed the call of the void and outfit your heroes in gear fit for overcoming the most severe of challenges.<br></li><li>4 exclusive stagecoach skins themed around Catacombs and Kingdoms enemy factions. Cover your coach in dripping slime or quivering sacks of eggs!</li></ul><br>The above items are visible tokens of our heartfelt gratitude, but know that any support you choose to give means even more!","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3591040?t=1744645838","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591040/63e0db4d826e0f00927aa74f661b09695d3db600/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744645838","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591040/9bb8fed925e31f08d61d05c0097def7e2ef789eb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744645838","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591040/9bb8fed925e31f08d61d05c0097def7e2ef789eb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744645838","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"no